<title>QATAR: SQUASH-SEMIFINAL RESULTS IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-SEMIFINAL RESULTS IN QATAR INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $65,000</p>
<p>Qatar International Squash Tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seedings):</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Julien Bonetat (France) 15-8</p>
<p>15-11 15-8</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat 5-Chris Walker (England) 17-16</p>
<p>15-10 11-15 15-10</p>
</text>
